      },
      {
        "top": "808",
        "left": "1766",
        "text": "together, building a visual language that serves"
      },
      {
        "top": "862",
        "left": "1766",
        "text": "each project’s purpose."
      },
      {
        "top": "646",
        "left": "164",
        "text": "I approach filmmaking through the image — light, composition,"
      },
      {
        "top": "700",
        "left": "164",
