        "top": "1091",
        "left": "2083",
        "text": "her father to come home, unaware of the"
      },
      {
        "top": "1136",
        "left": "2083",
        "text": "truth her mother has been hiding. For"
      },
      {
        "top": "1181",
        "left": "2083",
        "text": "years, her father had recorded a video for"
      },
      {
        "top": "1226",
        "left": "2083",
        "text": "every birthday — and this year, she is"
      },
      {
        "top": "1271",
        "left": "2083",
        "text": "about to watch the one he left behind."
